{"id": "37129", "title": "爱の真实", "author": "单飞雪", "category": "文学名著", "count": 20, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/37/37129.htm", "intro": "二十九岁的郭菲，真够衰的，老是在重要时刻脱线演出，\r\n在优秀杰出的家人眼中她就像根废柴，\r\n连未婚夫都因为看清她随兴的生活态度而毁婚。\r\n虚荣势利的姊姊为了让她有出息，叫爸妈赶她出门，\r\n只有姊夫大方出借房子让她住，看见她的真性情，觉得她好。\r\n她暗恋上温柔又强悍的他，如果他不是姊夫、如果他不是……\r\n唉！算了啦，她只要暗恋著他就好，他不是她该拥有的幸福。\r\n也许她该找个跟姊夫一样的男人，救她脱离这地狱般的苦境，\r\n但面对追求她的男人，她却只想著那个不能得到男人，\r\n暗恋怎么这么苦啊！偏偏恢复单身的他又给了她无穷希望……", "base": "files/article/html/37/37129", "chapters": [{"title": "第1章", "file": "2912264.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章", "file": "2912265.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章", "file": "2912266.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章", "file": "2912267.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章", "file": "2912268.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6章", "file": "2912269.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7章", "file": "2912270.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章", "file": "2912271.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9章", "file": "2912272.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第10章", "file": "2912273.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第11章", "file": "2912274.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第12章", "file": "2912275.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第13章", "file": "2912276.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第14章", "file": "2912277.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第15章", "file": "2912278.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第16章", "file": "2912279.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第17章", "file": "2912280.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第18章", "file": "2912281.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第19章", "file": "2912282.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第20章", "file": "2912283.html", "available": true}]}